OL,3,GNEWSATown 'desperate' for windmill to
OL,4,Abe repaired
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of a heritage group say they
OL,7,Ffeel "very aggrieved" that their town's
OL,8,Fwindmill is still awaiting repairs more
OL,9,Fthan six years after being damaged in a
OL,10,Fstorm.
OL,12,FThe Grade I listed Dobson's Mill in
OL,13,FBurgh le Marsh, near Skegness, had its
OL,14,Fsails ripped off during Storm Ciara in
OL,15,FFebruary 2020.
OL,17,FDuring a Lincolnshire County Council
OL,18,Fmeeting on Thursday, Mark Eyre, the
OL,19,Fhead of strategic asset management,
OL,20,Fsaid, while the county's windmills were
OL,21,Finspected each month, they were "very
OL,22,Fexpensive for materials and labour".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
